    "with": "            elif (\n                session.last_outcome is not None\n                and session.last_outcome[1] == \"error\"\n            ):\n                state = \"error\"",
    "test": "tests/test_activity_strip.py::test_a_run_that_stopped_to_ask_for_settings_is_in_the_strip"
  },
  {
    "label": "N5 on_completed 不再把結局寫回「真的跑的那個 session」（背景專案的 last_outcome 永遠是 None）",
